\v 3 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 6 7”} [answering]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Apm\sc* 4”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”}, \wj Have ye not read so much as this, what David did, when himself was an hungred, and they which were with him;\wj* 
\v 4 \wj How he went into the house of God, and did take and eat the shewbread, and gave also to them that were with him; which it is not lawful to eat but for the priests alone?\wj* 
\v 5 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [he said]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 2”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 3”}, \wj That the Son of man is Lord also of the sabbath.\wj* 
\v 6 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [it came to pass]{strong=“G1096” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Adi\sc*-3S 1”} [also]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 3”} [on]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 4”} [another]{strong=“G2087” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Dsn\sc* 5”} [sabbath]{strong=“G4521” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Dsn\sc* 6”}, [that he]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 8”} [entered]{strong=“G1525” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aan\sc* 7”} [into]{strong=“G1519” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 9”} [the synagogue]{strong=“G3588 G4864” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Asf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 10 11”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 12”} [taught]{strong=“G1321” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pan\sc* 13”}: [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 14”} [there]{strong=“G1563” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 16”} [was]{strong=“G2258” x-morph=“robinson: V-IXI-3S 15”} [a man]{strong=“G444” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 17”} [whose]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 21”} [right]{strong=“G1188” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsf\sc* 23”} [hand]{strong=“G3588 G5495” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsf\sc* 19 20”} [was]{strong=“G2258” x-morph=“robinson: V-IXI-3S 24”} [withered]{strong=“G3584” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsf\sc* 25”}. 
\v 7 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [the scribes]{strong=“G3588 G1122” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Npm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Npm\sc* 4 5”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 6”} [Pharisees]{strong=“G3588 G5330” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Npm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Npm\sc* 7 8”} [watched]{strong=“G3906” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3P 1”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 3”}, [whether]{strong=“G1487” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Cond\sc* 9”} [he would heal]{strong=“G2323” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Fai\sc*-3S 13”} [on]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 10”} [the sabbath day]{strong=“G3588 G4521” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsn\sc* 11 12”}; [that]{strong=“G2443” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 14”} [they might find]{strong=“G2147” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aas\sc*-3P 15”} [an accusation]{strong=“G2724” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 16”} [against him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 17”}. 
\v 8 [But]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [he]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Nsm\sc* 1”} [knew]{strong=“G1492” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Lai\sc*-3S 3”} [their]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gpm\sc* 6”} [thoughts]{strong=“G3588 G1261” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Apm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Apm\sc* 4 5”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 7”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 8”} [to the man]{strong=“G3588 G444” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsm\sc* 9 10”} [which had]{strong=“G2192” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Dsm\sc* 13”} [the withered]{strong=“G3584” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 12”} [hand]{strong=“G3588 G5495” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Asf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 14 15”}, \wj Rise up, and stand forth in the midst.\wj* [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 23”} [he arose]{strong=“G450” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 24”} [and stood forth]{strong=“G2476” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 25”}. 
\v 9 [Then]{strong=“G3767” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 1”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [unto]{strong=“G4314” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 5”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Apm\sc* 6”}, \wj I will ask you one thing; Is it lawful on the sabbath days to do good, or to do evil? to save life, or to destroy it?\wj* 
\v 10 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [looking round about upon]{strong=“G4017” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Amp\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Apm\sc* 4”} [all]{strong=“G3956” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Apm\sc* 3”}, [he said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”} [unto the man]{strong=“G3588 G444” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsm\sc* 6 7”}, \wj Stretch forth thy hand.\wj* [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 13”} [he did]{strong=“G4160” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3S 14”} [so]{strong=“G3779” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 15”}: [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 16”} [his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 20”} [hand]{strong=“G3588 G5495” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsf\sc* 18 19”} [was restored]{strong=“G600” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Api\sc*-3S 17”} [whole]{strong=“G5199” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsf\sc* 21”} [as]{strong=“G5613” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 22”} [the other]{strong=“G243” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsf\sc* 24”}. 
\v 11 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [they]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Npm\sc* 1”} [were filled]{strong=“G4130” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Api\sc*-3P 3”} [with madness]{strong=“G454” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 4”}; [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 5”} [communed]{strong=“G1255” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3P 6”} [one with]{strong=“G4314” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 7”} [another]{strong=“G240” x-morph=“robinson: C-\sc Apm\sc* 8”} [what]{strong=“G5101” x-morph=“robinson: I-\sc Asn\sc* 9”} [they might do]{strong=“G4160” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aao\sc*-3P-A 11”} [to Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsm\sc* 12 13”}. 
\v 12 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [it came to pass]{strong=“G1096” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Adi\sc*-3S 1”} [in]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 3”} [those]{strong=“G3778” x-morph=“robinson: D-\sc Dpf\sc* 6”} [days]{strong=“G3588 G2250” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dpf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dpf\sc* 4 5”}, [that he went out]{strong=“G1831” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 7”} [into]{strong=“G1519” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 8”} [a mountain]{strong=“G3588 G3735” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Asn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Asn\sc* 9 10”} [to pray]{strong=“G4336” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adn\sc* 11”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 12”} [continued all night]{strong=“G1273” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 14”} [in]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 15”} [prayer]{strong=“G3588 G4335” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsf\sc* 16 17”} [to God]{strong=“G3588 G2316” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 18 19”}. 
\p
\v 13 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [when]{strong=“G3753” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 2”} [it was]{strong=“G1096” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Adi\sc*-3S 3”} [day]{strong=“G2250” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsf\sc* 4”}, [he called]{strong=“G4377” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”} unto him [his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 8”} [disciples]{strong=“G3588 G3101” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Apm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Apm\sc* 6 7”}: [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 9”} [of]{strong=“G575” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 11”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gpm\sc* 12”} [he chose]{strong=“G1586” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Amp\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 10”} [twelve]{strong=“G1427” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nui\sc* 13”}, [whom]{strong=“G3739” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Apm\sc* 14”} [also]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 15”} [he named]{strong=“G3687” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3S 17”} [apostles]{strong=“G652” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Apm\sc* 16”}; 
\v 14 [Simon]{strong=“G4613” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 1”}, ([whom]{strong=“G3739” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Asm\sc* 2”} [he]{strong=“G3687” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3S 4”} [also]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 3”} [named]{strong=“G3687” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3S 4”} [Peter]{strong=“G4074” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 5”},) [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 6”} [Andrew]{strong=“G406” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 7”} [his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 10”} [brother]{strong=“G3588 G80” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Asm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 8 9”}, [James]{strong=“G2385” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 11”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 12”} [John]{strong=“G2491” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 13”}, [Philip]{strong=“G5376” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 14”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 15”} [Bartholomew]{strong=“G918” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 16”}, 
\v 15 [Matthew]{strong=“G3156” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 1”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [Thomas]{strong=“G2381” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 3”}, [James]{strong=“G2385” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 4”} [the]{strong=“G3588” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Asm\sc* 5”} son [of Alphæus]{strong=“G3588 G256” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 6 7”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 8”} [Simon]{strong=“G4613” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 9”} [called]{strong=“G2564” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ppp\sc*-\sc Asm\sc* 11”} [Zelotes]{strong=“G2207” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 12”}, 
\v 16 [And Judas]{strong=“G2455” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 1”} the brother [of James]{strong=“G2385” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 2”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 3”} [Judas]{strong=“G2455” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 4”} [Iscariot]{strong=“G2469” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asm\sc* 5”}, [which]{strong=“G3739” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Nsm\sc* 6”} [also]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 7”} [was]{strong=“G1096” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Adi\sc*-3S 8”} [the traitor]{strong=“G4273” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 9”}. 
\p
\v 17 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [he came down]{strong=“G2597” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [with]{strong=“G3326” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 3”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gpm\sc* 4”}, [and stood]{strong=“G2476” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”} [in]{strong=“G1909” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 6”} [the plain]{strong=“G3977” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gsm\sc* 8”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 9”} [the company]{strong=“G3793” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 10”} [of his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 12”} [disciples]{strong=“G3101” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gpm\sc* 11”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 13”} [a great]{strong=“G4183” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsn\sc* 15”} [multitude]{strong=“G4128” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsn\sc* 14”} [of people]{strong=“G3588 G2992” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 16 17”} [out]{strong=“G575” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 18”} [of all]{strong=“G3956” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gsf\sc* 19”} [Judæa]{strong=“G3588 G2449” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 20 21”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 22”} [Jerusalem]{strong=“G2419” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Pri\sc* 23”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 24”} [from the sea coast]{strong=“G3882” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gsf\sc* 26”} [of Tyre]{strong=“G5184” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 27”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 28”} [Sidon]{strong=“G4605” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 29”}, [which]{strong=“G3739” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Npm\sc* 30”} [came]{strong=“G2064” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3P 31”} [to hear]{strong=“G191” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aan\sc* 32”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 33”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 34”} [to be healed]{strong=“G2390” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Apn\sc* 35”} [of]{strong=“G575” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 36”} [their]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gpm\sc* 39”} [diseases]{strong=“G3588 G3554” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gpf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gpf\sc* 37 38”}; 
\v 18 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [they that were vexed]{strong=“G3791” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ppp\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 3”} [with]{strong=“G5259” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 4”} [unclean]{strong=“G169” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gpn\sc* 6”} [spirits]{strong=“G4151” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gpn\sc* 5”}: [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 7”} [they were healed]{strong=“G2323” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ipi\sc*-3P 8”}. 
\v 19 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [the whole]{strong=“G3956” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [multitude]{strong=“G3588 G3793” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [sought]{strong=“G2212” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 5”} [to touch]{strong=“G680” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pmn\sc* 6”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 7”}: [for]{strong=“G3754” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 8”} [there went]{strong=“G1831” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ini\sc*-3S 12”} [virtue]{strong=“G1411” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsf\sc* 9”} [out]{strong=“G3844” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 10”} [of him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 11”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 13”} [healed]{strong=“G2390” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ini\sc*-3S 14”} them [all]{strong=“G3956” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Apm\sc* 15”}. 
\p
\v 20 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [he]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [lifted up]{strong=“G1869” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 3”} [his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 6”} [eyes]{strong=“G3588 G3788” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Apm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Apm\sc* 4 5”} [on]{strong=“G1519” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 7”} [his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 10”} [disciples]{strong=“G3588 G3101” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Apm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Apm\sc* 8 9”}, [and said]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 11”}, \wj Blessed be ye poor: for yours is the kingdom of God.\wj* 
\v 21 \wj Blessed are ye that hunger now: for ye shall be filled. Blessed are ye that weep now: for ye shall laugh.\wj* 
\v 22 \wj Blessed are ye, when men shall hate you, and when they shall separate you from their company, and shall reproach you, and cast out your name as evil, for the Son of man’s sake.\wj* 
\v 23 \wj Rejoice ye in that day, and leap for joy: for, behold, your reward is great in heaven: for in the like manner did their fathers unto the prophets.\wj* 
\v 24 \wj But woe unto you that are rich! for ye have received your consolation.\wj* 
\v 25 \wj Woe unto you that are full! for ye shall hunger. Woe unto you that laugh now! for ye shall mourn and weep.\wj* 
\v 26 \wj Woe unto you, when all men shall speak well of you! for so did their fathers to the false prophets.\wj* 
\p
\v 27 \wj But I say unto you which hear, Love your enemies, do good to them which hate you,\wj* 
\v 28 \wj Bless them that curse you, and pray for them which despitefully use you.\wj* 
\v 29 \wj And unto him that smiteth thee on the one cheek offer also the other; and him that taketh away thy cloke forbid not to take thy coat also.\wj* 
\v 30 \wj Give to every man that asketh of thee; and of him that taketh away thy goods ask them not again.\wj* 
\v 31 \wj And as ye would that men should do to you, do ye also to them likewise.\wj* 
\v 32 \wj For if ye love them which love you, what thank have ye? for sinners also love those that love them.\wj* 
\v 33 \wj And if ye do good to them which do good to you, what thank have ye? for sinners also do even the same.\wj* 
\v 34 \wj And if ye lend to them of whom ye hope to receive, what thank have ye? for sinners also lend to sinners, to receive as much again.\wj* 
\v 35 \wj But love ye your enemies, and do good, and lend, hoping for nothing again; and your reward shall be great, and ye shall be the children of the Highest: for he is kind unto the unthankful and to the evil.\wj* 
\v 36 \wj Be ye therefore merciful, as your Father also is merciful.\wj* 
\v 37 \wj Judge not, and ye shall not be judged: condemn not, and ye shall not be condemned: forgive, and ye shall be forgiven:\wj* 
\v 38 \wj Give, and it shall be given unto you; good measure, pressed down, and shaken together, and running over, shall men give into your bosom. For with the same measure that ye mete withal it shall be measured to you again.\wj* 
\v 39 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [he spake]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 1”} [a parable]{strong=“G3850” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 3”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 4”}, \wj Can the blind lead the blind? shall they not both fall into the ditch?\wj* 
\v 40 \wj The disciple is not above his master: but every one that is perfect shall be as his master.\wj* 
\v 41 \wj And why beholdest thou the mote that is in thy brother’s eye, but perceivest not the beam that is in thine own eye?\wj* 
\v 42 \wj Either how canst thou say to thy brother, Brother, let me pull out the mote that is in thine eye, when thou thyself beholdest not the beam that is in thine own eye? Thou hypocrite, cast out first the beam out of thine own eye, and then shalt thou see clearly to pull out the mote that is in thy brother’s eye.\wj* 
\v 43 \wj For a good tree bringeth not forth corrupt fruit; neither doth a corrupt tree bring forth good fruit.\wj* 
\v 44 \wj For every tree is known by his own fruit. For of thorns men do not gather figs, nor of a bramble bush gather they grapes.\wj* 
\v 45 \wj A good man out of the good treasure of his heart bringeth forth that which is good; and an evil man out of the evil treasure of his heart bringeth forth that which is evil: for of the abundance of the heart his mouth speaketh.\wj* 
\p
\v 46 \wj And why call ye me, Lord, Lord, and do not the things which I say?\wj* 
\v 47 \wj Whosoever cometh to me, and heareth my sayings, and doeth them, I will shew you to whom he is like:\wj* 
\v 48 \wj He is like a man which built an house, and digged deep, and laid the foundation on a rock: and when the flood arose, the stream beat vehemently upon that house, and could not shake it: for it was founded upon a rock.\wj* 
\v 49 \wj But he that heareth, and doeth not, is like a man that without a foundation built an house upon the earth; against which the stream did beat vehemently, and immediately it fell; and the ruin of that house was great.\wj* 
\c 7
\p 
