\p
\v 31 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [the Lord]{strong=“G3588 G2962” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 1”}, \wj Whereunto then shall I liken the men of this generation? and to what are they like?\wj* 
\v 32 \wj They are like unto children sitting in the marketplace, and calling one to another, and saying, We have piped unto you, and ye have not danced; we have mourned to you, and ye have not wept.\wj* 
\v 33 \wj For John the Baptist came neither eating bread nor drinking wine; and ye say, He hath a devil.\wj* 
\v 34 \wj The Son of man is come eating and drinking; and ye say, Behold a gluttonous man, and a winebibber, a friend of publicans and sinners!\wj* 
\v 35 \wj But wisdom is justified of all her children.\wj* 
\p
