\v 39 [Now]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [when]{strong=“G1492” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 1”} [the Pharisee]{strong=“G3588 G5330” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [which]{strong=“G3588” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* 5”} [had bidden]{strong=“G2564” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 6”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 7”} [saw]{strong=“G1492” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 1”} it, [he spake]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 11”} [within]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 9”} [himself]{strong=“G1438” x-morph=“robinson: F-3\sc Dsm\sc* 10”}, [saying]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 8”}, [This man]{strong=“G3778” x-morph=“robinson: D-\sc Nsm\sc* 12”}, [if]{strong=“G1487” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Cond\sc* 13”} [he were]{strong=“G2258” x-morph=“robinson: V-IXI-3S 14”} [a prophet]{strong=“G4396” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 15”}, [would have known]{strong=“G1097” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 16”} [who]{strong=“G5101” x-morph=“robinson: I-\sc Nsm\sc* 18”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 19”} [what manner]{strong=“G4217” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsf\sc* 20”} [of woman]{strong=“G3588 G1135” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsf\sc* 21 22”} this is [that]{strong=“G3748” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Nsf\sc* 23”} [toucheth]{strong=“G680” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pmi\sc*-3S 24”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 25”}: [for]{strong=“G3754” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 26”} [she is]{strong=“G2076” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pxi\sc*-3S 28”} [a sinner]{strong=“G268” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nsf\sc* 27”}. 
\v 40 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [answering]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”} [unto]{strong=“G4314” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 6”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 7”}, \wj Simon, I have somewhat to say unto thee.\wj* [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 14”} [he saith]{strong=“G5346” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pxi\sc*-3S 15”}, [Master]{strong=“G1320” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Vsm\sc* 16”}, [say on]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aam\sc*-2S 17”}. 
\v 41 \wj There was a certain creditor which had two debtors: the one owed five hundred pence, and the other fifty.\wj* 
\v 42 \wj And when they had nothing to pay, he frankly forgave them both. Tell me therefore, which of them will love him most?\wj* 
\v 43 [Simon]{strong=“G3588 G4613” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [answered]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aop\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 1”} [and]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”}, [I suppose]{strong=“G5274” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-1S 6”} [that]{strong=“G3754” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 7”} he, [to whom]{strong=“G3739” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Dsm\sc* 8”} [he forgave]{strong=“G5483” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adi\sc*-3S 11”} [most]{strong=“G4119” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Asn\sc*-C 10”}. [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 13”} [he said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 14”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 15”}, \wj Thou hast rightly judged.\wj* 
\v 44 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [he turned]{strong=“G4762” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc App\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [to]{strong=“G4314” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 3”} [the woman]{strong=“G3588 G1135” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Asf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 4 5”}, [and said]{strong=“G5346” x-morph=“robinson: V-IXI-3S 8”} [unto Simon]{strong=“G3588 G4613” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsm\sc* 6 7”}, \wj Seest thou this woman? I entered into thine house, thou gavest me no water for my feet: but she hath washed my feet with tears, and wiped them with the hairs of her head.\wj* 
\v 45 \wj Thou gavest me no kiss: but this woman since the time I came in hath not ceased to kiss my feet.\wj* 
\v 46 \wj My head with oil thou didst not anoint: but this woman hath anointed my feet with ointment.\wj* 
\v 47 \wj Wherefore I say unto thee, Her sins, which are many, are forgiven; for she loved much: but to whom little is forgiven, the same loveth little.\wj* 
\v 48 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [he said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 1”} [unto her]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsf\sc* 3”}, \wj Thy sins are forgiven.\wj* 
\v 49 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [they]{strong=“G756” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adi\sc*-3P 2”} [that]{strong=“G3588” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Npm\sc* 3”} [sat at meat with him]{strong=“G4873” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pnp\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 4”} [began]{strong=“G756” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adi\sc*-3P 2”} [to say]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pan\sc* 5”} [within]{strong=“G1722” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 6”} [themselves]{strong=“G1438” x-morph=“robinson: F-3\sc Dpm\sc* 7”}, [Who]{strong=“G5101” x-morph=“robinson: I-\sc Nsm\sc* 8”} [is]{strong=“G2076” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pxi\sc*-3S 10”} [this]{strong=“G3778” x-morph=“robinson: D-\sc Nsm\sc* 9”} [that]{strong=“G3739” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Nsm\sc* 11”} [forgiveth]{strong=“G863” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 14”} [sins]{strong=“G266” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Apf\sc* 13”} [also]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 12”}? 
\v 50 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [he said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 1”} [to]{strong=“G4314” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 3”} [the woman]{strong=“G3588 G1135” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Asf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 4 5”}, \wj Thy faith hath saved thee; go in peace.\wj* 
\c 8
\p 
\v 1 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [it came to pass]{strong=“G1096” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Adi\sc*-3S 2”} [afterward]{strong=“G2517” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 5”}, [that]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 6”} [he]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Nsm\sc* 7”} [went throughout]{strong=“G1353” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 8”} [every]{strong=“G2596” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 9”} [city]{strong=“G4172” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 10”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 11”} [village]{strong=“G2968” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 12”}, [preaching]{strong=“G2784” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 13”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 14”} [shewing the glad tidings]{strong=“G2097” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pmp\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 15”} [of the kingdom]{strong=“G3588 G932” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Asf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 16 17”} [of God]{strong=“G3588 G2316” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 18 19”}: [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 20”} [the twelve]{strong=“G1427” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nui\sc* 22”} were [with]{strong=“G4862” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 23”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 24”}, 
\v 2 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [certain]{strong=“G5100” x-morph=“robinson: X-\sc Npf\sc* 3”} [women]{strong=“G1135” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Npf\sc* 2”}, [which]{strong=“G3739” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Npf\sc* 4”} [had been]{strong=“G2258” x-morph=“robinson: V-IXI-3P 5”} [healed]{strong=“G2323” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Rpp\sc*-\sc Npf\sc* 6”} [of]{strong=“G575” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 7”} [evil]{strong=“G4190” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gpn\sc* 9”} [spirits]{strong=“G4151” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gpn\sc* 8”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 10”} [infirmities]{strong=“G769” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gpf\sc* 11”}, [Mary]{strong=“G3137” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsf\sc* 12”} [called]{strong=“G2564” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Ppp\sc*-\sc Nsf\sc* 14”} [Magdalene]{strong=“G3094” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsf\sc* 15”}, [out of]{strong=“G575” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 16”} [whom]{strong=“G3739” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Gsf\sc* 17”} [went]{strong=“G1831” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Lai\sc*-3S 20”} [seven]{strong=“G2033” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nui\sc* 19”} [devils]{strong=“G1140” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Npn\sc* 18”}, 
\v 3 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [Joanna]{strong=“G2489” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 2”} [the wife]{strong=“G1135” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsf\sc* 3”} [of Chuza]{strong=“G5529” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 4”} [Herod’s]{strong=“G2264” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 6”} [steward]{strong=“G2012” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 5”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 7”} [Susanna]{strong=“G4677” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsf\sc* 8”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 9”} [many]{strong=“G4183” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Npf\sc* 11”} [others]{strong=“G2087” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Npf\sc* 10”}, [which]{strong=“G3748” x-morph=“robinson: R-\sc Npf\sc* 12”} [ministered]{strong=“G1247” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3P 13”} [unto him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dsm\sc* 14”} [of]{strong=“G575” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 15”} [their]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpf\sc* 18”} [substance]{strong=“G5224” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Gpn\sc* 17”}. 
\p
\v 4 [And when]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [much]{strong=“G4183” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Gsm\sc* 4”} [people]{strong=“G3793” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsm\sc* 3”} [were gathered together]{strong=“G4896” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pxp\sc*-\sc Gsm\sc* 1”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 5”} [were come]{strong=“G1975” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pnp\sc*-\sc Gpm\sc* 9”} [to]{strong=“G4314” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 10”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 11”} [out of every]{strong=“G2596” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 7”} [city]{strong=“G4172” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Asf\sc* 8”}, [he spake]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 12”} [by]{strong=“G1223” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 13”} [a parable]{strong=“G3850” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Gsf\sc* 14”}: 
\v 5 \wj A sower went out to sow his seed: and as he sowed, some fell by the way side; and it was trodden down, and the fowls of the air devoured it.\wj* 
\v 6 \wj And some fell upon a rock; and as soon as it was sprung up, it withered away, because it lacked moisture.\wj* 
\v 7 \wj And some fell among thorns; and the thorns sprang up with it, and choked it.\wj* 
\v 8 \wj And other fell on good ground, and sprang up, and bare fruit an hundredfold.\wj* [And when he had said]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 15”} [these things]{strong=“G5023” x-morph=“robinson: D-\sc Apn\sc* 14”}, [he cried]{strong=“G5455” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 16”}, \wj He that hath ears to hear, let him hear.\wj* 
\v 9 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [his]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gsm\sc* 6”} [disciples]{strong=“G3588 G3101” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Npm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Npm\sc* 4 5”} [asked]{strong=“G1905” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3P 1”} [him]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Asm\sc* 3”}, [saying]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pap\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 7”}, [What]{strong=“G5101” x-morph=“robinson: I-\sc Nsf\sc* 8”} [might]{strong=“G1498” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pxo\sc*-3S 9”} [this]{strong=“G3778” x-morph=“robinson: D-\sc Nsf\sc* 12”} [parable]{strong=“G3588 G3850” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsf\sc* 10 11”} [be]{strong=“G1498” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pxo\sc*-3S 9”}? 
\v 10 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [he said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 3”}, \wj Unto you it is given to know the mysteries of the kingdom of God: but to others in parables; that seeing they might not see, and hearing they might not understand.\wj* 
\v 11 \wj Now the parable is this: The seed is the word of God.\wj* 
\v 12 \wj Those by the way side are they that hear; then cometh the devil, and taketh away the word out of their hearts, lest they should believe and be saved.\wj* 
\v 13 \wj They on the rock are they, which, when they hear, receive the word with joy; and these have no root, which for a while believe, and in time of temptation fall away.\wj* 
\v 14 \wj And that which fell among thorns are they, which, when they have heard, go forth, and are choked with cares and riches and pleasures of this life, and bring no fruit to perfection.\wj* 
\v 15 \wj But that on the good ground are they, which in an honest and good heart, having heard the word, keep it, and bring forth fruit with patience.\wj* 
\p
\v 16 \wj No man, when he hath lighted a candle, covereth it with a vessel, or putteth it under a bed; but setteth it on a candlestick, that they which enter in may see the light.\wj* 
\v 17 \wj For nothing is secret, that shall not be made manifest; neither any thing hid, that shall not be known and come abroad.\wj* 
\v 18 \wj Take heed therefore how ye hear: for whosoever hath, to him shall be given; and whosoever hath not, from him shall be taken even that which he seemeth to have.\wj* 
