\v 22 [Saying]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 1”}, \wj The Son of man must suffer many things, and be rejected of the elders and chief priests and scribes, and be slain, and be raised the third day.\wj* 
\p
\v 23 [And]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [he said]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Iai\sc*-3S 1”} [to]{strong=“G4314” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 3”} them [all]{strong=“G3956” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Apm\sc* 4”}, \wj If any man will come after me, let him deny himself, and take up his cross daily, and follow me.\wj* 
\v 24 \wj For whosoever will save his life shall lose it: but whosoever will lose his life for my sake, the same shall save it.\wj* 
\v 25 \wj For what is a man advantaged, if he gain the whole world, and lose himself, or be cast away?\wj* 
\v 26 \wj For whosoever shall be ashamed of me and of my words, of him shall the Son of man be ashamed, when he shall come in his own glory, and in his Father’s, and of the holy angels.\wj* 
\v 27 \wj But I tell you of a truth, there be some standing here, which shall not taste of death, till they see the kingdom of God.\wj* 
\p
