\v 30 \wj Who shall not receive manifold more in this present time, and in the world to come life everlasting.\wj* 
\p
\v 31 [Then]{strong=“G1161” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 2”} [he took]{strong=“G3880” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 1”} unto him [the twelve]{strong=“G1427” x-morph=“robinson: A-\sc Nui\sc* 4”}, [and said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”} [unto]{strong=“G4314” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 6”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Apm\sc* 7”}, \wj Behold, we go up to Jerusalem, and all things that are written by the prophets concerning the Son of man shall be accomplished.\wj* 
\v 32 \wj For he shall be delivered unto the Gentiles, and shall be mocked, and spitefully entreated, and spitted on:\wj* 
\v 33 \wj And they shall scourge him, and put him to death: and the third day he shall rise again.\wj* 
